%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":"22px","actorFontSize":"22px","messageFontSize":"20px","noteFontSize":"20px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":110,"messageMargin":65,"diagramMarginX":45,"diagramMarginY":25}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Learner as Learner
    participant FE as React Frontend<br/>(Writing Lesson)
    participant BE as Node.js/Express Backend<br/>(Writing Module)
    participant LLM as NVIDIA LLM API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(245, 248, 255)
    Note over Learner,DB: Phase 1 - Load Writing lesson
    Learner->>FE: Open Writing lesson
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/writing/lessons or /lessons/:id
    BE->>BE: Verify JWT and learner role
    BE->>DB: Select lessons, exercises, vocabulary and progress
    DB-->>BE: Writing lesson payload
    BE-->>FE: 200 lesson detail
    FE-->>Learner: Show prompt and answer input
    end

    rect rgb(248, 255, 246)
    Note over Learner,LLM: Phase 2 - Check answer with similarity and LLM feedback
    Learner->>FE: Submit English answer
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/writing/check
    BE->>BE: Validate text, normalize text and calculate similarity
    alt Similarity is clearly correct or clearly wrong
        BE->>BE: Use deterministic fallback scoring
    else Similarity is ambiguous
        BE->>LLM: POST chat completion with Writing feedback prompt
        alt NVIDIA returns valid JSON feedback
            LLM-->>BE: Score, pass state, feedback and corrected text
            BE->>BE: Normalize AI feedback
        else NVIDIA fails, times out or returns invalid JSON
            LLM--xBE: Error response
            BE->>BE: Fall back to similarity scoring
        end
    end
    BE-->>FE: 200 score, pass state, feedback and corrected text
    FE-->>Learner: Show feedback and continue exercise
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
    Note over Learner,DB: Phase 3 - Save Writing progress and rewards
    Learner->>FE: Finish Writing lesson
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/writing/progress
    BE->>DB: Read previous WritingProgress and upsert latest progress
    alt First completion
        BE->>DB: Update UserStats with Writing EXP
        BE->>DB: Complete matching DailyTasks and reward daily EXP
    else Already completed or in progress
        BE->>BE: Skip duplicate lesson EXP
    end
    BE-->>FE: 200 progress saved and reward summary
    FE-->>Learner: Show completion screen
    end
